  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is like a jellyfish: fist-sized, soft and tiny. Reverse Flow River washed it onto Fang Yuan’s face, and it stuck to his forehead.",
        "chapters": [
          1272
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He held this jellyfish-like Gu in his hand. It has a soft body. The jellyfish body was very tattered, with a huge injury about a quarter of its size.",
        "chapters": [
          1273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Central Continent had placed the Gu in Edge Link Camp with many mortal Gu so the Immortal Gu House could track love Gu, even inside an immortal aperture. That setup is what let Edge Link Camp follow love Immortal Gu to Snowy Mountain blessed land. After the house breaks, the Gu is one of the worms swept into the river.",
        "chapters": [
          1273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "edge-link-camp-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_central_continent",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu_house",
          "gu_love_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "loc_snowy_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With Attitude Gu and Unravel Mystery, he later counts affection Gu and vajra thought Gu as four wisdom path Immortal Gu in hand.",
        "chapters": [
          1305
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-immortal-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_attitude_gu",
          "gu_unravel_mystery",
          "gu_vajra_thought_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Self love Immortal Gu and affection Immortal Gu are very compatible; with a few mortal Gu they form an immortal killer move that produces a vast amount of self will.",
        "chapters": [
          1426
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-immortal-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_love_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Activating both with red date immortal essence and many mortal Gu creates a tidal wave of self will shaped into a giant resembling Fang Yuan.",
        "chapters": [
          1423
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-immortal-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That killer move later lets him hold immortal level self will Gu and an endless supply of wills for the light of wisdom.",
        "chapters": [
          1447
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-immortal-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_will_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When he uses Affection and Self Love on Soul Beast Token, affection will lingers after Qing Chou’s will destroys most of it; that lingering effect is the specialty of affection Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1529
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-immortal-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_soul_beast_token",
          "char_qing_chou"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is rank seven. Affection Gu feeds on the same thing as love Gu: hope and fear. Fang Yuan buys large numbers of Hope Gu and Fear Gu from treasure yellow heaven to cover that need.",
        "chapters": [
          1291
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
