  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan pulls the Gu from Reverse Flow River after Edge Link Camp breaks apart, and Bi Chen Tian confirms what it is.",
        "chapters": [
          1273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_reverse_flow_river",
          "house_edge_link_camp",
          "char_bi_chen_tian"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The body can survive impacts that crush most Gu, which is how it lasts in Reverse Flow River, though the specimen Fang Yuan holds is tattered, with an injury about a quarter of its size. Inside the river, Gu auras are sealed, so Fang Yuan cannot read its rank there.",
        "chapters": [
          1273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bi Chen Tian treats the Gu as low value for most Gu Immortals: mortal will Gu already cover ordinary will work, conflicting dao marks weaken other-path Immortal Gu, and affection Immortal Gu alone does not form immortal killer moves. Fang Yuan keeps it because he needs wisdom path Immortal Gu, his sovereign immortal body has no conflicting dao marks, and he already has wisdom path grandmaster attainment. He pockets it in the river, where the immortal aperture cannot open.",
        "chapters": [
          1273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "why-fang-yuan-keeps-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan considers trading it for Immortal Gu that suit him better, but Reverse Flow River blocks transactions. Bi Chen Tian then fights him for it. When punches threaten him underwater, Fang Yuan holds the Gu in front of Bi Chen Tian’s fist so Bi Chen Tian pulls back rather than risk destroying it, and Fang Yuan uses those openings.",
        "chapters": [
          1274
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-over-the-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
